From: gtxaspec <gtxent@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 16 Nov 2026 22:19:23 -0800
Subject: [PATCH 3/5] scripts/dtc: Remove redundant YYLOC global declaration

Backport of upstream e33a814e772c: GCC >= 10 defaults to -fno-common and
the host dtc fails to link with a duplicate yylloc.
---
 scripts/dtc/dtc-lexer.l | 1 -
 1 file changed, 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/scripts/dtc/dtc-lexer.l b/scripts/dtc/dtc-lexer.l
index 615b7ec65..d3694d6cf 100644
--- a/scripts/dtc/dtc-lexer.l
+++ b/scripts/dtc/dtc-lexer.l
@@ -38,7 +38,6 @@ LINECOMMENT	"//".*\n
 #include "srcpos.h"
 #include "dtc-parser.tab.h"
 
-YYLTYPE yylloc;
 extern bool treesource_error;
 
 /* CAUTION: this will stop working if we ever use yyless() or yyunput() */
